{"2887460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "diorama", "steam_appid": 2887460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...No thoughts, just head empty and decorate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >so... what to do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you can customize and freely expand/resize most furniture~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > change both weather and time to affect the atmosphere of your diorama~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > most furniture is interactable (and squishable...)~ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > custom furniture (drag and drop sprites into the game...)~ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > invite friends to help you decorate your diorama (this game is not guaranteed to actually ship with friends but i'm working on it.....)~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > pop bubble wrap~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > there are no beds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > other stuff...? (there are around 1000 decorative pieces or so; despite the obvious decor counter, i’m not actually able to count this high yet so i’m just guessing really….)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>seriously though, this is just yet another decorating game so all you do is place stuff meaning you should keep your expectations low; but i still hope that you ultimately end up liking diorama since I put a lot of work into it!!</i>~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >controls... but what do they do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD / arrow keys</strong> - move around your diorama</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>left mouse button</strong> - place furniture anywhere you like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>right mouse button </strong> - customize most furniture by changing their colour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>middle mouse button </strong> - copy any selected furniture (surprisingly, this might be the most underused button in most games...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> - flip/mirror furniture (useful for non-symmetric furniture...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F</strong> - search for furniture by typing names or keywords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E</strong> - hide the interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >˚ ༘♡ ⋆｡˚ ❀</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...No thoughts, just head empty and decorate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >so... what to do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you can customize and freely expand/resize most furniture~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > change both weather and time to affect the atmosphere of your diorama~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > most furniture is interactable (and squishable...)~ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > custom furniture (drag and drop sprites into the game...)~ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > invite friends to help you decorate your diorama (this game is not guaranteed to actually ship with friends but i'm working on it.....)~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > pop bubble wrap~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > there are no beds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > other stuff...? (there are around 1000 decorative pieces or so; despite the obvious decor counter, i’m not actually able to count this high yet so i’m just guessing really….)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>seriously though, this is just yet another decorating game so all you do is place stuff meaning you should keep your expectations low; but i still hope that you ultimately end up liking diorama since I put a lot of work into it!!</i>~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 cla